    course_description = '<h4>Overview</h4><p>The challenges and opportunities presented by the fast growing industry of sustainable tourism requires qualified professionals with an international mindset.</p> <p>The Graduate Certificate of International Sustainable Tourism Management is designed for both emerging professionals and those wishing to enhance their understanding without a background in the industry. In the degree you will explore and analyse the global tourism industry, and build essential skills in critical thinking, writing and presentation in multicultural settings to enhance your learning success and career capabilities.</p><h4>Structure</h4><p>You complete two core units which provide knowledge, skills, attitudes and values required of skilled practitioners working in a range of fields addressing tourism.</p> <p><strong>Course progression map</strong></p> <p>The <a href="https://www.monash.edu/arts/course-information/maps/">course progression map</a> provides guidance on unit enrolment for each semester of study.</p>',
